# Pinned dependency trees of colo-slim: the frozen Megatron-LM / Megatron-Bridge worktrees and the TE overlay that
# the research notes, summarized in docs/colo/ writes into a snapshot's .snapshot_pins (with absolute roots) and that
# nemo_rl/utils/module_provenance.py enforces at startup. Commit = git HEAD of the pinned tree, hash = module_provenance.tree_hash
# of the package files. *_DIR names the tree (Megatron: next to the RL checkout; TE: the batch-invariant overlay).
# Tested by research/thundersync_rl/tests/unit/test_snapshot_pins_manifest.py.
